1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Open the IOC Scan page in the Scanning Console

2
00:00:03,695 --> 00:00:06,695
Enter the target host IP address (10.83.1.113)

3
00:00:04,572 --> 00:00:07,572
Select SMB protocol and enter Windows credentials

4
00:00:06,784 --> 00:00:09,784
Click Start IOC Scan

5
00:00:09,831 --> 00:00:12,831
The scanner mounts the target via SMB/CIFS, then runs LOKI-RS

6
00:00:39,863 --> 00:00:42,863
LOKI-RS scans files against YARA rules and known threat hashes

7
00:10:13,441 --> 00:10:16,441
Scan complete — findings are categorized by severity

8
00:10:15,958 --> 00:10:18,958
Alerts (red) require immediate investigation

9
00:10:18,969 --> 00:10:21,969
Click any finding to see file hashes, matched rules, and tags
